    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "This integer $k$ is called the index of $a$ with respect to the primitive root $g$, and is denoted by"
    },
    {
      "category": "equation_isolated",
      "order": 9,
      "latex": "$$k = \\operatorname{ind}_{g}(a).$$"
    },
    {
      "category": "text_block",
